{"seq":3,"slug":"llm-corpora-contamination-compliance","title":"大模型语料污染、脱敏与合规实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/corpus-linguistics-language-resource-engineering/language-resource-governance-llm/llm-corpora-contamination-compliance","wordCount":3036,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"大模型语料污染-脱敏与合规实操\">大模型语料污染、脱敏与合规实操</h1><p>2023 年之后，语料工程的问题清单发生了一次重心迁移：过去语料库学家操心的是代表性（见本 hub 的<a href=\"../corpus-design-representativeness-model/representativeness-bias-audit\">代表性偏差审计</a>），而当语料规模从千万词扩到万亿 token、用途从语言研究换成大模型训练时，「这份语料能不能用、用了会有什么后果」变成了独立的三类风险——<strong>基准污染</strong>让评测数字不可信，<strong>未脱敏的隐私与重复内容</strong>让模型记住并泄露训练数据，<strong>版权与训练数据保留声明</strong>让整批语料在某个司法辖区直接不可用。三者技术手段不同、责任主体不同，却常被笼统地叫成「数据清洗」。本文按工程实操把它们拆开，并说明 2026 年监管与协议层的真实约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三类风险由三套彼此独立的机制治理\">核心概念：三类风险由三套彼此独立的机制治理</h2><p>把「语料有问题」当成一个笼统标签，最典型的症状是去重做了、PII 洗了，却仍然在 MMLU 上刷出虚高分，或在欧盟境内无法上线。根因是三类风险的<strong>触发条件、检测信号与修复动作都不重叠</strong>：</p>\n<p>关键认识：<strong>去重与去污不是同一个动作，合规检查也不在清洗流水线之内</strong>。去重是语料内部的相似度归并，去污是语料与外部基准的交叉比对，合规是语料与外部法律/协议状态的比对。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>检测信号</th>\n<th>修复动作</th>\n<th>责任人</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基准污染</td>\n<td>训练语料与测试集的 n-gram/语义重叠</td>\n<td>移除命中样本或换私有评测集</td>\n<td>模型开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐私与记忆</td>\n<td>逐字复制率、PII 命中数</td>\n<td>精确子串去重 + PII 擦除</td>\n<td>数据工程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版权/合规</td>\n<td>许可清单、robots/偏好信号</td>\n<td>来源白名单、opt-out 剔除、留档</td>\n<td>法务 + 平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基准污染-从-n-gram-匹配到语义去污\">基准污染：从 n-gram 匹配到语义去污</h2><p><strong>基准污染（benchmark contamination）<strong>指评测基准的样本（尤其是测试集）以某种形式进入了训练数据，导致模型在基准上的分数不再反映泛化能力。Sainz 等人 2023 年的立场论文把事情挑明：最严重的形态是「在基准的测试集上训练，再在同一基准上评测」，而这类污染会抬高测得性能、导致论文结论无效，因此他们主张</strong>逐个基准分别测量污染</strong>，并标记结论可能受污染的论文（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.18018\">arXiv:2310.18018</a>，EMNLP 2024 Findings）。</p>\n<p>第一代去污用<strong>字符串匹配</strong>：把训练语料与测试集做 n-gram 重叠检测。设测试样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 切成长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的连续片段集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_n(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，训练语料片段集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_n(D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_n(t) \\cap G_n(D) \\neq \\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span> 则判定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 被污染。实现上常取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span>（GPT-3 系论文做法）或按词取 8-gram。这类方法快、可审计，但有一个致命盲点：<strong>改写能绕过字面匹配</strong>。Golchin 与 Surdeanu 2023 年证明，把测试样本改写、翻译、或换一种表述后混入训练集，13-gram 匹配几乎全部漏掉；他们用 13B 模型在改写后的测试项上训练，就能在 MMLU、GSM8K、HumanEval 上刷出接近 GPT-4 的分数，并在 RedPajama-Data-1T 与 StarCoder-Data 中查出 HumanEval 高达 8–18% 的隐藏重叠，其中还包括 GPT-3.5/4 生成的合成数据（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.04850\">arXiv:2311.04850</a>）。他们的对策是 <strong>LLM 去污</strong>：用语言模型判断语义重叠而非字面重叠，工具开源为 <code>llm-decontaminator</code>。</p>\n<p>工程上这意味着 2026 年的去污流程通常是<strong>两级</strong>：先用廉价 n-gram 匹配扫全量、拦掉绝大多数，再对候选做语义级复核。两级都需要记录命中率，因为去污强度本身是可观测指标——若某基准重叠率异常高，问题往往不在去污而在数据来源（例如抓到了论文仓库或数据集镜像站）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"去重与-pii-脱敏-语料清洗的两条工程线\">去重与 PII 脱敏：语料清洗的两条工程线</h2><p>大模型「背诵」训练数据，主要不是因为参数量大，而是因为数据里有大量重复。Lee 等人 2021 年的经典工作把这条因果链量化了：C4 中存在<strong>一个 61 词的英文句子被重复了 6 万次以上</strong>，未去重模型超过 1% 的无提示输出是从训练数据逐字复制出来的；作者构建了<strong>精确子串去重</strong>（移除长重复序列）与<strong>近重复去重</strong>（基于 MinHash 归并相似样本）两类工具，报告去重后记忆文本在输出中的出现频率下降约十倍，且以更少训练步数达到相当或更好精度（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.06499\">arXiv:2107.06499</a>，ACL 2022）。</p>\n<p>近重复去重的标准做法是 <strong>MinHash + LSH</strong>。对每个文档取其 shingle 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个哈希函数取每个集合的最小哈希值，得到签名向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sig</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sig}(S)=(\\min_{x\\in S}h_1(x),\\dots,\\min_{x\\in S}h_k(x))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sig</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>。两个文档真实 Jaccard 相似度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(S_1,S_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的无偏估计正是签名相同分量的比例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>J</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></munder><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></munder><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{J}=\\frac{1}{k}\\sum_{i=1}^{k}\\mathbb{1}\\!\\left[\\min_{x\\in S_1}h_i(x)=\\min_{x\\in S_2}h_i(x)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">[</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8444em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8444em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>LSH 把签名向量分桶，只在桶内做两两比较，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的比较降到近似线性；万亿 token 规模上仍需分布式实现，Dolma、RefinedWeb、RedPajama 等公开语料都公开了各自的去重参数。</p>\n<p><strong>PII 脱敏</strong>是另一条线，且与去重正交：去重处理的是「同一段文本出现多次」，脱敏处理的是「这段文本里有不该留的内容」。实操分层进行：结构化 PII（邮箱、电话、身份证号、信用卡号）用正则加<strong>校验位验证</strong>（如 Luhn 算法）降低误报，命中后替换为占位符或哈希；非结构化 PII（人名、住址、机构）用 NER 模型识别后再决定擦除或泛化，误报率高，通常配合人工抽样审计；清洗后仍需做一次<strong>对抗性抽取测试</strong>（用前缀补全钓出训练样本），确认清洗确实降低了逐字复现率，而不是只改了统计口径。需要强调一个取舍：<strong>脱敏不可逆，且擦除会让上下文破碎</strong>——把邮箱替换成 <code>&lt;EMAIL&gt;</code> 会轻微改变语言分布，因此脱敏版本与原始版本在语料快照中应当是<strong>两个可区分的版本</strong>，而非就地覆盖，否则后期无法复核某次泄露到底来自哪个版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"训练数据合规-eu-ai-act-tdm-保留与偏好信号\">训练数据合规：EU AI Act、TDM 保留与偏好信号</h2><p>合规不是清洗算法能解决的问题，它约束的是<strong>这份语料能不能进入训练、以及必须留下什么记录</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>欧盟层面</strong>，AI Act 第 53 条自 <strong>2025 年 8 月 2 日</strong>起对通用目的 AI（GPAI）模型提供者生效（<a href=\"https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/53/\">artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/53</a>），核心义务包括：建立并维护训练与测试过程的文档（对齐 Annex XI）、准备提供给下游集成者的信息（Annex XII）、<strong>制定遵守欧盟版权法的政策</strong>（尤其是识别并尊重《数字化单一市场版权指令》2019/790 第 4(3) 条下的<strong>权利保留</strong>，且要「通过最先进的技术」实现）、以及<strong>公开发布训练内容摘要</strong>（使用 AI Office 发布的模板）。免费开源模型豁免前两项文档义务，但<strong>版权政策与训练内容摘要义务仍然适用</strong>。</p>\n<p>**权利保留（TDM opt-out）**是整个合规链的枢纽：2019/790 第 4 条允许以文本与数据挖掘（TDM）为目的复制作品，但权利人可以通过「适当方式」明确保留这一权利，从而把该作品排除出 TDM 例外。这就是为什么 2026 年的语料工程必须把规格化的 <strong>opt-out 信号</strong>作为来源白名单的一部分。</p>\n<p><strong>协议层</strong>正在把偏好的表达标准化。IETF 的 <strong>AI Preferences (aipref)</strong> 工作组（Web and Internet Transport 领域）正在制定「building blocks」，让内容发布者可以表达对 AI 训练使用其内容的偏好，主要交付物包括一份<strong>标准轨的偏好词汇表</strong>（<code>draft-ietf-aipref-vocab</code>）与一份把偏好绑定到内容上的协议规范（<code>draft-ietf-aipref-attach</code>，覆盖 Well-Known URIs、Robots 排除协议与 HTTP 响应头），两者里程碑均设为 <strong>2026-08-31 提交 IESG</strong>；工作组明确排除技术强制执行、爬虫认证、偏好注册表与 AI 训练审计（<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/wg/aipref/about/\">IETF aipref 章程</a>）。截至写作时这两份文档尚未成为 RFC。</p>\n<p>现实中的偏好信号是<strong>多头并存</strong>的。Common Crawl 的爬虫 CCBot 支持在 robots.txt 中用 <code>User-agent: CCBot / Disallow: /</code> 阻止抓取，并提供 opt-out registry；其条款（2024-03-07 版）并未禁止 AI 训练，反而明确涵盖「人工智能、机器学习或类似技术」的使用，但把 AI 相关的专利、版权、隐私、诽谤等索赔风险全部转给使用者（<a href=\"https://commoncrawl.org/terms-of-use\">commoncrawl.org</a>）。与此同时，偏好表达<strong>不均衡且不断收紧</strong>：Data Provenance Initiative 对 C4、RefinedWeb、Dolma 背后的 <strong>1.4 万个域名</strong>在 2023–2024 年做审计，发现一年内限制令 <strong>C4 中约 5%+ 的 token 完全不可用</strong>、<strong>28%+ 最活跃维护的关键来源</strong>受限，而按服务条款计算的爬取限制覆盖了 <strong>C4 的 45%</strong>（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.14933\">arXiv:2407.14933</a>，<em>Consent in Crisis</em>）。这解释了为什么「语料能用」是一个<strong>有时间戳的状态</strong>，而不是语料的固有属性。治理良好的一次实践是 BigScience 的 ROOTS 语料：1.6TB、59 种语言，用于训练 176B 参数的 BLOOM，强调伦理、伤害预防与治理驱动的协作流程（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.03915\">arXiv:2303.03915</a>）——其意义不在技术，而在示范了<strong>语料可以带上完整的来源与许可记录一起发布</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"语料治理流水线-版本-溯源与可审计\">语料治理流水线：版本、溯源与可审计</h2><p>把三类风险串成一条可运行的流水线，落点是一张<strong>数据卡 + 版本快照</strong>。每一次语料变更（重新抓取、重新去重、脱敏、合规剔除）都产生一个新版本号，版本记录至少包含来源域名与许可、各来源的 opt-out 检查时间戳、去污与去重参数及命中率、PII 擦除统计、以及本次变更的破坏性标记。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[来源登记&lt;br/&gt;域名/许可/偏好快照] --&gt; B[去重&lt;br/&gt;精确子串 + MinHash/LSH]&#10;  B --&gt; C[PII 脱敏&lt;br/&gt;正则+校验位 + NER]&#10;  C --&gt; D[去污&lt;br/&gt;n-gram 预筛 + LLM 语义复核]&#10;  D --&gt; E[合规剔除&lt;br/&gt;opt-out + 许可白名单]&#10;  E --&gt; F[发布数据卡&lt;br/&gt;版本号 + 残余风险 + 不可用来源]&#10;  F --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[来源登记&lt;br/&gt;域名/许可/偏好快照] --&gt; B[去重&lt;br/&gt;精确子串 + MinHash/LSH]\n  B --&gt; C[PII 脱敏&lt;br/&gt;正则+校验位 + NER]\n  C --&gt; D[去污&lt;br/&gt;n-gram 预筛 + LLM 语义复核]\n  D --&gt; E[合规剔除&lt;br/&gt;opt-out + 许可白名单]\n  E --&gt; F[发布数据卡&lt;br/&gt;版本号 + 残余风险 + 不可用来源]\n  F --&gt; A</pre><p>可复现性在这里比在纯研究语料里更硬：如果合规状态随时会变，那么「某次训练用的是哪版语料、当时各来源的许可是什么」必须可被第三方重放。这与本 hub 早前讨论的<a href=\"../corpus-format-query-index/corpus-serialization-format-model\">语料序列化与版本模型</a>是同一原则在不同规模上的体现——offset 与注解要版本化，来源与许可同样要版本化。<strong>合规剔除不可逆且会改变数据分布</strong>，因此剔除必须记录被移除的规模与特征，否则后续的模型行为差异将无法归因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>「语料有问题」是三类彼此独立的风险：基准污染、隐私与记忆、版权与合规；检测信号与修复动作不重叠，必须分开治理。</li>\n<li>基准污染的第一代 n-gram 匹配会被改写绕过；Golchin 与 Surdeanu 证明改写后混入可刷出接近 GPT-4 的分数，对策是 LLM 语义去污，实践上采用 n-gram 预筛 + 语义复核两级流程。</li>\n<li>逐字记忆的根因是重复：去重（精确子串 + MinHash/LSH 近重复）让记忆文本出现频率下降约十倍；PII 脱敏与去重正交且不可逆，脱敏版本应作为独立版本保留。</li>\n<li>合规的枢纽是 TDM 权利保留与训练数据摘要：EU AI Act 第 53 条自 2025-08-02 生效；IETF aipref 正在标准化偏好词汇与绑定方式（里程碑 2026-08-31）。</li>\n<li>偏好信号多头并存且持续收紧——C4 中 45% 已受服务条款爬取限制、约 5%+ token 因限制令完全不可用——因此「语料能用」是带时间戳的状态，必须靠版本化数据卡与来源溯源保证可审计与可复现。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大模型语料污染、脱敏与合规实操","id":"大模型语料污染-脱敏与合规实操"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类风险由三套彼此独立的机制治理","id":"核心概念-三类风险由三套彼此独立的机制治理"},{"level":2,"text":"基准污染：从 n-gram 匹配到语义去污","id":"基准污染-从-n-gram-匹配到语义去污"},{"level":2,"text":"去重与 PII 脱敏：语料清洗的两条工程线","id":"去重与-pii-脱敏-语料清洗的两条工程线"},{"level":2,"text":"训练数据合规：EU AI Act、TDM 保留与偏好信号","id":"训练数据合规-eu-ai-act-tdm-保留与偏好信号"},{"level":2,"text":"语料治理流水线：版本、溯源与可审计","id":"语料治理流水线-版本-溯源与可审计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"语料版本管理、血缘追踪与治理流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/corpus-linguistics-language-resource-engineering/language-resource-governance-llm/versioning-pipeline-governance"},"next":null}